[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5783.95, "timestamp": "01:36:23", "text": "耶。他媽的。去他媽的。去他媽的。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5786.04, "timestamp": "01:36:26", "text": "不， 喲，這安靜得真快。我的天哪。  說實話，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5796.31, "timestamp": "01:36:36", "text": "我今天就到此為止了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5798.149, "timestamp": "01:36:38", "text": "我也是。我要走了，我要從我這邊出去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5802.79, "timestamp": "01:36:42", "text": "。你們保重。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5812.95, "timestamp": "01:36:52", "text": "你能站在樓梯上嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5815.03, "timestamp": "01:36:55", "text": "好的。  好的。  再見。我的天哪。再見。再見。"}]